  "details": "Since the latest UI update group banners become squashed, literally none of mine now show remotely accurate information. I've been waiting for this bug to be fixed but so far it hasn't.\n\nI can't find any way to revert back to the better system and I know VRC devs are better than the sorts of folks who mess with their neurodivergent users by breaking a feature some of us rely on to interact better with other users. I figure this has to be a bug.\n\nI play on PC, other platforms may be affected",
